 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the road from Moab the dust was cold and grey",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Naomi turned to her daughters and she told them go away",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go back home to your mothers, find a husband and a bed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Ruth held on to her and this is what she said",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where you go I will go",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And where you stay I will stay",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your people will be my people",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your God my God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where you die I will die",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And there I will be buried",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing but death will part you and me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the fields of Bethlehem she gathered fallen grain",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Walking behind the reapers in the sun and in the rain",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A kind man named Boaz saw the stranger at his door",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Said may you find your refuge under the wings of the LORD",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where you go I will go",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
